  "does_not_close": "This receipt does not itself build the crosswalk; it documents that the MEASURED/MODELED/ASSUMED tagging scheme CF-TIER's done_criterion requires has not been authored anywhere in the deliverable corpus. A follow-on CF-TIER fire (this item's second and final scheduled fire) can attempt an in-scope repair using cro_protocol.md/capture_template.json (the CF-PROC precedent showed the acceptance checker concatenates blueprint.md + these two cro-protocol-packager-owned files, so tags added to the latter two are visible to a crosswalk checker without editing blueprint.md), or file the gap as requiring a report-packager-scoped campaign item if per-BOM-line tagging must live in blueprint.md itself.",
